{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"A Bad Nun","html":"<article id='sn19.18'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 19.18 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 19.18 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>2. Dutiyavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Two </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Pāpabhikkhunīsutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>A Bad Nun </span></h1></header>\n<p><span class='root'>“Addasaṁ bhikkhuniṁ vehāsaṁ gacchantiṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“I saw a nun flying through the air. </span>\n<span class='root'>Tassā saṅghāṭipi ādittā …pe… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Her outer robe was burning …” … </span></p>\n<p><span class='root'>pāpabhikkhunī ahosi …pe…. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“She used to be a bad nun …” </span></p>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Aṭṭhamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
